  message: "pass12: extended to numeric param validation. compact silently accepts --max-symbols 0 (produces 1 node), --max-symbols -5 (silent), --coverage 2.0 (out of documented range; returns 100=default max), --coverage -1 (negative; returns 100). No clamping warning. Filed as SSS (INV-nonag) since X was scoped to invalid flags only, but the structural pattern is the same — compact has no parameter validation."  # d591
